              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Сде­ла­ем за­ме­ну <span data-inline-latex=\"y=\\log_{(x+1)} (2x-5)\"></span> , по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"y+\\frac{1}{y}\\le 2\\iff \\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{y}\\le 0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}y\\lt 0\\\\y=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center><p> Воз­вра­ща­ясь к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной, рас­смат­ри­ва­ем два слу­чая:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(x+1)} (2x-5)=1\\iff \\begin{cases}x+1=2x-5\\\\x+1\\gt 0\\\\x+1\\ne 1\\end{cases}\\iff x=6\"></span>,</p></center><p>или</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(x+1)} (2x-5)\\lt 0\\iff \\begin{cases}(2x-5-1)(x+1-1)\\lt 0\\\\x+1\\gt 0\\\\2x-5\\gt 0\\\\x+1\\ne 1\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}(2x-6)x\\lt 0\\\\x\\gt \\frac{5}{2}\\end{cases}\\iff \\frac{5}{2}\\lt x\\lt 3\"></span>.</span></p></center><p><b>При­ме­ча­ние.</b> На об­ла­сти опре­де­ле­ния не­ра­вен­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_a b\\lt 0\"></span> рав­но­силь­но не­ра­вен­ству  <span data-inline-latex=\"(a-1)(b-1)\\lt 0\"></span>.</p>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
          },
