              "html": "<p>Вос­поль­зу­ем­ся свой­ства­ми ло­га­риф­ма:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(2x-1)} (4x-5)+\\frac{1}{\\log_{(2x-1)} (4x-5)}\\le 2\"></span>. </p></center><p>Сде­ла­ем за­ме­ну <span data-inline-latex=\"y=\\log_{(2x-1)} (4x-5)\"></span> :</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"y+\\frac{1}{y}\\le 2\\iff \\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{y}\\le 0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}y=1y\\lt 0\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center><p>Если  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(2x-1)} (4x-5)=1\"></span>, то</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}2x-1=4x-5\\\\2x-1\\gt 0\\\\2x-1\\ne 1\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff x=2\"></span>.  </p></center><p>Если  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(2x-1)} (4x-5)\\lt 0\"></span>, то</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{4x-5-1}{2x-1-1}&lt;0,\\\\2x-1&gt;0,\\\\4x-5&gt;0,\\\\2x-1\\ne 1\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{2x-3}{x-1}&lt;0,\\\\x&gt;\\dfrac{5}{4}\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\dfrac{5}{4}&lt;x&lt;\\dfrac{3}{2}.\"></span></p></center><p>Зна­чит, ре­ше­ние дан­но­го не­ра­вен­ства  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{5}{4}\\lt x\\lt \\frac{3}{2}\"></span>  или <span data-inline-latex=\"x=2\"></span>.</p>",
