              "html": "<p>За­ме­тим, что вто­рое сла­га­е­мое об­рат­но пер­во­му. Сде­ла­ем за­ме­ну <span data-inline-latex=\"t=\\log_{(2x+1)} (4x-5)=t\"></span> тогда:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"t+\\frac{1}{t}\\le 2\\iff \\frac{t^{2}-2t+1}{t}\\le 0\\iff \\frac{(t-1)^{2}}{t}\\le 0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}t=1\\\\t\\lt 0\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center><p>Из урав­не­ния со­во­куп­но­сти по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(2x+1)} (4x-5)=1\\iff \\begin{cases}2x+1=4x-5\\\\2x+1\\gt 0\\\\2x+1\\ne 1\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff x=3\"></span>.</p></center><p>Из не­ра­вен­ства со­во­куп­но­сти по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(2x+1)} (4x-5)\\lt 0\\iff \\frac{\\lg (4x-5)}{\\lg (2x+1)}\\lt 0\\iff \\frac{\\lg (4x-5)-\\lg 1}{\\lg (2x+1)-\\lg 1}\\lt 0\\iff \\begin{cases}\\frac{4x-6}{2x}\\lt 0\\\\4x-5\\gt 0\\\\2x+1\\gt 0\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\begin{cases}0\\lt x\\lt \\frac{3}{2}\\\\x\\gt \\frac{5}{4}\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\frac{5}{4}\\lt x\\lt \\frac{3}{2}\"></span> . </span></p></center>",
